# Personal Note
I am going to be perfectly honest: I know very little about how to make, load, use, and unload shaders. HLSL is foreign
to me, and all the shaders implementations you see before you are cheap tricks mostly to fill for my own projects'
needs for shaders. It may not be possible to add or change the structure, nor add additional shaders outside of
creating your own shader loader.